      {8x_{1}} & + & {3x_{2}} & = & 2 \\
      {5x_{1}} & + & {2x_{2}} & = & {- 1}
      \end{matrix}$$

Let $A = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{rr}
      1 & 2 \\
      5 & 12
      \end{array} \right\rbrack$, $\mathbf{b}_{1} = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
      {- 1} \\
      3
      \end{array} \right\rbrack$, $\mathbf{b}_{2} = \left\lbrack \begin{array}{r}
      1 \\
      {- 5}
      \end{array} \right\rbrack$, $\mathbf{b}_{3} = \begin{bmatrix}
      2 \\
      6
      \end{bmatrix}$ and $\mathbf{b}_{4} = \begin{bmatrix}
      3 \\
      5
      \end{bmatrix}$﻿.
